          <h2>Transit Access &amp; Urban Equity</h2>
          <p>Four transit systems collapsed into one routing graph. An hour of
          public transport buys Jakarta’s median resident 4.29% of the region’s
          jobs — and Bodetabek’s median resident 0.05%. 38% of Jabodetabek
          cannot reach a hospital within the hour.</p>
